    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Note to GMs</span></p>\n<p>Yes, the spell mention Wisdom for damage at the initial level (3), then Charisma for damage at higher levels both in the original PDF and on the online SRD.</p>\n<p>For me, it doesn't make sense, so I changed the initial level to CHA to have a more fluid progression (and to not penalize a stat choice). Still, your game, your call, so you should discuss it with the player that takes this spell (e.g. to keep to original attribute choice, or to instead make all damage roll with WIS, although this will make the spell more powerful), then remove this description for the spell on the Cleric char-sheet (to not be spammed each time the spell is used)</p>"
