    "special": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Special",
      "value": "<p>Nearby enemies suffer [[1d10 + @cha.dmg]] holy damage every round until the escalation die equals [[@lvl]] (to a maximum of 6 rounds). A normal save (11+) halves this damage, although demons, devils, and undead must instead make a hard save (16+).</p>\n<p>At the GM&rsquo;s discretion, you can also cast this spell to eliminate a single environmental effect of your tier or lower which bolsters demons, devils, or undead, or which deals negative energy damage to you and your allies; the effect is suppressed for the same number of rounds.</p>"
